                              "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                              "args": {
                                "text": [
                                  "The spring closes\nthe valve with a\nsmall click. Rivet\nrepeats the test\nwith the power",
                                  "disconnected. The\nsame click\nanswers. Pip says\nit sounds less\ngrand than",
                                  "expected. Rivet\nsays good safety\nequipment often\nhas excellent\nmanners."
                                ],
